 ><tr><td style="width: 99.9123%\;" colspan="2"><p style="text-align: cent
 er\;">          &#160\;        </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><stron
 g><em>Capturing the Campus: T.C. Steele\, Indiana University's First Arti
 st in Residence</em></strong></p><p><em>Capturing the Campus</em> pays tr
 ibute to renowned Hoosier artist T.C. Steele. The exhibit honors the cent
 ury that has passed since his death by showcasing paintings form the arti
 st's residency at IU and other relevant works. The exhibit will bring tog
 ether Steele's landscapes from the IU Public Art and Cultural Heritage Co
 llection and the Indiana State Museum and Historic Sites' collection\, al
 lowing the holdings of these two collections to be viewed in one space.  
       </p><p style="text-align: center\;"><strong>Dates: April 17\, 2026 
