 "><p style="text-align: center\;"><em><strong>Multipurpose Room</strong><
 /em></p><p>          Currently Featuring: <em>The Gift of Collecting: Spo
 tlight on Rudy Pozzatti</em></p><p>          Rudy Pozzatti\, a world-reno
 wned artist\, is attributed with developing the printmaking program at In
 diana University. This exhibit features his works\, which were donated by
  Jim and Joyce Grandorf to the IU Public Art and Cultural Heritage Collec
